 "unreadable": [
  "Slashed zeros read as 0 (e.g. PE0, PB0, TCA0-WO0); 'WO' in TCA0-WOn read as letter O (unslashed)"
 ],
 "notes": "Labels use the ATmega4809 port name (Pxn) where printed, else the board/power name; 'PA2/PF2' and 'PA3/PF3' kept as printed single labels. Functions read outward from the pin; exact repeats dropped; RESET overbar not representable. Image 1 prints MISO/MOSI and PA2/PA3; images 2-3 print CIPO/COPI and PA2/PF2, PA3/PF3. Image 4 pad names under the 'SAMD11' heading (SWDIO, SWCLK, PA14/PA15, PA28) kept as outward functions where not exact repeats. Skipped: LED callouts (LED_BUILTIN (D13), Power, TX/RX LED), USB N/USB P callout in image 4 (only two lines into the USB connector, no full pin map), SAMD11 internal pin map."
}
